# FlightMind AI — Agentic Flight Operations Assistant

An AI-powered agentic assistant for airline operations built with 
LangChain, FastAPI, and GPT-4 with RAG-based flight knowledge retrieval.

## What This Project Does
- Answers real-time flight status questions using RAG pipeline
- Recommends rebooking options for cancelled/delayed flights  
- Calculates AAdvantage loyalty miles automatically
- Handles baggage policy questions intelligently
- Remembers conversation history across multiple turns
- Deployed as production REST API with Docker on AWS ECS

## Tech Stack
- Python, FastAPI
- LangChain, LangGraph, OpenAI GPT-4
- FAISS Vector Store, OpenAI Embeddings
- PostgreSQL, Redis
- Docker, AWS ECS, GitHub Actions CI/CD

